@startuml
title Checkout Flow
actor Customer
participant "Nuxt Frontend" as Frontend
participant "SokoHub API" as Api
participant "Cart" as Cart
participant "Checkout" as Checkout
participant "Inventory" as Inventory
participant "Payment" as Payment
participant "Orders" as Orders
participant "RabbitMQ" as Broker
participant "Notifications" as Notifications

Customer -> Frontend: add items to cart
Frontend -> Api: GET /api/cart
Api -> Cart: load cart
Cart --> Api: cart items
Api --> Frontend: cart
Customer -> Frontend: start checkout
Frontend -> Api: POST /api/checkout
Api -> Checkout: create checkout session
Checkout -> Inventory: reserve items
Inventory --> Checkout: reservations
Checkout -> Payment: initiate payment
Payment --> Checkout: payment intent
Checkout -> Orders: place and split order
Orders --> Checkout: order and vendor orders
Checkout --> Api: checkout result
Api --> Frontend: checkout response
Payment -> Broker: PaymentInitiated
Broker -> Notifications: notify customer
@enduml
